<para>Can be used in a combination with <ref refid="msgpuck_8h_1a62895683215afc37ef70bd9ad9db903b" kindref="member">mp_decode_extl()</ref> instead of mp_decode_uuid() when multiple extension types are possible.</para><para><parameterlist kind="param"><parameteritem>
